2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to allocate these spaces. I want to understand the history of our conflicts first.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I just want everyone to be happy and feel it's fair. Let's find a way to make it work!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should be cautious. The physical reality of the parking area is just as important as the rules we set.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get too emotional. We need hard data on the costs and the actual usage before we start dreaming.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Shunichi. We must consider the long-term administrative burden of any system we implement.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I'll look into the ""Five years of association minutes"" and ""Last year's complaint log entries"" to see where we've failed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" and ""Five years of association minutes"" to see who is using the bikes!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll examine ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows"" to assess the physical conditions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the ""The building account's two-year ledger"" and ""The ward cycle park by the station"" to get a sense of the finances.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will investigate the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and ""Trial of the supplier's display frame"" to gauge the workload.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
