25,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we've had a stagnant arrangement for years, and the complaints are vague but persistent. We can't just keep ignoring it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Yumi,,I found out that some people who ride every day would actually prefer to pay for a spot! That's so interesting!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The physical situation is poor. People are shifting bikes to get out, and some spots are completely exposed to the rain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Our shared account is nearly empty, and the local ward park is expensive and over capacity. We can't rely on outside options.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Managing payments is already a chore for the treasurer. Adding more billing would increase the monthly workload significantly.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the spots are uneven in quality, a simple lottery might just move the resentment from one person to another.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, that's true! But if the daily riders are willing to pay, maybe we can use that to make things fairer?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, payment doesn't fix the rain or the morning congestion. We need a solution that addresses how the bikes actually sit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, if the treasurer is already struggling, we should avoid any system that requires complex monthly bookkeeping.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Exactly. And if we introduce new hardware, like racks, we have to consider the physical maintenance required to keep them working.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"We need to avoid a system that creates social friction. If we just charge money, we might alienate some residents.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Yumi,,But wouldn't it be nice if the people who really need the spots could get them? I want everyone to feel included!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Inclusion is fine, but efficiency is better. The current ""shoving match"" in the morning is a failure of the current layout.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be rational. We have no budget for major works, and the ward park is full. The solution must be internal.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"I'm concerned that any ""fair"" system will just become another abandoned chore for the association. Simplicity is key.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
